  dialogueLines:
  - The Cornucopia is not meant for your pockets. It is a vessel of renewal. Carry
    it to the <color=orange>altar basin</color>, place it upon the stone, and watch
    the vessels fill.
  - "Fortuna\u2019s grace will return to this world\u2026 and the <color=orange>path</color>
    you came from will open."
